{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は青森にてRABまつりに出演してきました〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった青森の皆さんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠征組の皆さんはるばるありがとうだってばよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青森は私が中3のとき吹奏楽部の東北大会の会場だったのでその時以来でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大会の時の事思い出したりしてジーンとしました(ノ∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVE！やっぱり楽しいですね〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手を振って一緒に楽しめて嬉しかったヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZEPPLIVEの後では初めてのLIVEでした！成長した成果を出せたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またできる様に頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか青森の皆さんまた呼んで下さ〜い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/07/6158343/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZIP!のイベントなどでお世話になった桝アナウンサーとパシャり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/07/6158343/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爽やか笑顔！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒も爽やか笑顔できる様になりたいな〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ東北の空気はよい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れてるからもあるけど秋の冷えた空気が凄く心地よくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと外にいたくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜は車の音の代わりに鈴虫が鳴ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月明かりがまぶしいくらい輝いているのに目を閉じるとすっと眠りにつくの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふるさとって大切だよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこの前のブログの生駒からの質問答えてくれてありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでると乃木坂が絶対必要だー！と書いてるひとちらほらいた〜(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにいこまも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーほんと〜ほんと〜(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照れちゃう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと音楽を聴く事が多かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒も音楽ないと一日過ごせないな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまた質問してもいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたのふるさとのよい所教えてっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも握手会とかで聞かれる事が多いけど聞いたことあんまりなかったから聞きたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかコメント読むんじゃなくて会話してるみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってるの生駒だけっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/07/6158343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}